.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.idea/
.vscode/
# deploy-time artifacts — regenerated by the Pages workflow on every deploy.
# all.html and sitemap.xml embed the date of the last commit that touched data/,
# so committing them would make every data change fail its own sync check.
site/data/
site/all.html
site/sitemap.xml
# changelog.html and feed.xml are derived from git history, which a pull request cannot
# know the shape of before GitHub merges it — a committed copy would fail its own sync
# check on every data change (the same trap all.html documents above).
site/changelog.html
site/feed.xml
# llms.txt / llms-full.txt embed today's counts, same reason as all.html above.
site/llms.txt
site/llms-full.txt
# og:image must be served from the Pages domain — copied from assets/ at deploy time.
site/social-preview.png
# local render intermediate — assets/banner.png IS this file (see CONTRIBUTING.md)
assets/social-preview@2x.png
